1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,150
A Warrior...

25
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,270
You

26
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,550
will all

27
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,710
die here.

28
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:19,350
Die !

29
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:19,830
Die !

30
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,350
Die !

31
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,150
Kill him !

32
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,600
His physical body can withstand the celestial sword ?

33
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,520
Only my original body

34
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,710
will be able to fight him.

35
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:52,830
Scram !

36
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,550
Kill him...

37
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,470
Kill...

38
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,830
Attack together !

39
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,670
The invaders

40
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,150
must die.

41
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,360
No one’s chasing me ?

42
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,190
Weird...

43
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,300
Whatever,

44
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,080
let’s just run for now.

45
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:53,000
If I don’t kill this guy right now,

46
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,220
I definitely won’t be able to leave.

47
00:03:56,760 --> 00:04:01,150
Invader, the punishment for destroying our tree will be

48
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,430
your death.

49
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,350
I will

50
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,760
grant your death wish.

51
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,590
Your sword

52
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,350
is too weak !

53
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,950
God Slaying Chariot,

54
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,750
let me see if you are

55
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,230
worthy of your name.

56
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,630
It's only a demonic beast ?

57
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:29,710
It will die !

58
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,630
This beast soul is too slow...

59
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,850
I don't have time for that...

60
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,670
Master,

61
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,390
I can’t hold on much longer.

62
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,150
Master, if you keep using me like this

63
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:53,670
my Sword Spirit will dissipate.

64
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,790
This tattoo power

65
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,030
is truly formidable.

66
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:59,430
You can’t stop me !

67
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,230
Help !

68
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,110
I don't need to stop you.

69
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,430
This beast

70
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,870
is too vicious.

71
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,610
This God Slaying Chariot

72
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,720
is really worthy of being called a celestial treasure.

73
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,070
But with my current cultivation

74
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:55,920
it’s hard to withstand the beast trap's spiritual energy consumption.

75
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,230
The God Slaying Chariot takes too long to activate...

76
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,670
In front of a 7-leaf Shaman,

77
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,110
if it doesn’t activate in time

78
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,760
I won't survive.

79
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,360
Mu Ye
Forsaken Immortal Clan
7-leaf Shaman

80
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,070
This Junior invader

81
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:45,270
was able to escape from my eyes.

82
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,870
He has some skills...

83
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:59,760
Half a month later

84
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,710
If the enemy finds me,

85
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,210
I’ll have no way out.

86
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,190
Junior invader,

87
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:26,230
this old man has been waiting for you.

88
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:33,030
With your lowly Early stage Soul Formation cultivation

89
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,150
you managed to kill a 6-leaf Warrior.

90
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:40,630
You must be well known in the cultivation world above.

91
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,990
What’s your name ?

92
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,040
Wang Lin

93
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:50,110
The artifact you used to kill the Warrior

94
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:53,310
is that bracelet of yours, right ?

95
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,550
The scent of a beast

96
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,830
emanates from it.

97
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,990
The exit is sealed,

98
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,910
you can’t escape !

99
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:13,830
Tell me the method you used to hide your presence

100
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,230
and I’ll keep your body intact

101
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:20,350
and plant a tattoo in you myself.

102
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:24,230
You will become my tattoo puppet !

103
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:35,630
You have quite a few artifacts on you, Junior.

104
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,350
That's a good sword.

105
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:49,830
This item carries a hint of heavenly power.

106
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:53,870
But this is the Immortal Graveyard,

107
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,790
tribulations

108
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,590
cannot fall here.

109
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,830
What a powerful pressure.

110
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,240
The cultivation gap is too wide,

111
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,760
I can’t wait for the God Slaying Chariot to activate.

112
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,470
Unfolding it, tearing it, or throwing it,

113
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,240
there must be a way to use this scroll.

114
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,390
This scroll

115
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:30,630
why is it similar to our holy treasure ?

116
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:35,470
Now there’s only one way to escape.

117
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,080
Although it’s extremely dangerous,

118
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,080
it is better than waiting here to die.

119
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:54,350
A spatial rift...

120
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:59,030
So what if you escape into the void ?

121
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:03,670
It’s easy to get lost in the void

122
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:08,350
and you can’t break space to leave from within

123
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,670
Where will you escape to ?

124
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,720
Immortal Graveyard
Void

125
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:28,190
This Junior actually has a treasure to traverse the void...

126
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,990
His identity must be extraordinary.

127
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:37,670
He’s the perfect candidate for my tattoo puppet.

128
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:43,030
This old man said

129
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,870
that I’ll leave your corpse intact.

130
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,750
What a powerful soul !

131
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,550
Instead of waiting for my spiritual energy to run out,

132
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,030
I’ll take the initiative to attack.

133
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:19,550
You dare to continue to resist ?

134
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:22,000
I'm just fighting to survive.

135
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,270
You want to kill the both of us ?

136
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:28,430
You overestimate yourself !

137
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,290
I have put the first tattoo on your soul.

138
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,130
Even if you don’t die

139
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,630
you will still become my tattoo puppet.

140
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,950
You got me good

141
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,470
but I’ll risk my life

142
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,520
to pay you back threefold !

143
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,920
With both the celestial sword and the beast soul,

144
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,110
even a 7-leaf Shaman

145
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,870
may not escape unscathed.

146
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:36,790
I reached the 7-leaf stage

147
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,390
by understanding this tattoo.

148
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,310
Junior,

149
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:44,830
now that you have seen this tattoo,

150
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,430
you can die in peace !

151
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:10,990
To think my tattoos have been damaged to this extent...

152
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,590
You fight like a cornered beast !

153
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,930
The tattoo seed I planted in you

154
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:19,350
is impossible to dissociate from your soul

155
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,410
unless your cultivation

156
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,310
surpasses mine !

157
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,190
The rate of absorption is growing...

158
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,330
What is most important right now

159
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:38,070
is removing this tattoo.

160
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:41,670
Once my Origin Soul is completely enveloped by it,

161
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,190
I will become a tattoo puppet.

162
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:48,280
The tattoo spreads from the plant on my brow...

163
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,710
The plant...?

164
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:50,950
Wood element !

165
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,020
Heaven Defying Bead !

166
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,030
Since the tattoo is a plant,

167
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,590
as it’s wood element

168
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,700
it can be absorbed by the Heaven Defying Bead.

169
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:06,910
This gamble

170
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:08,700
is my only chance.

171
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,790
Under the influence of the tattoo

172
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:13,310
he can still control his artifacts

173
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,830
and hold on for this long !

174
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:46,720
It worked !

175
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,970
With these pills and top-grade spirit stones,

176
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:52,960
I should be able to hold on until he exhausts himself.

177
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:58,110
Why does this Junior have so many artifacts ?

178
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:02,280
He even has something that can remove the tattoo seed !

179
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,190
Thanks to Senior’s guidance

180
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:34,040
Junior has mastered the star compass’s teleportation ability.

181
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:39,510
He completely removed the tattoo seed

182
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:42,430
and maintained this speed for months.

183
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:50,350
That Junior has endless treasures...

184
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:52,360
If I keep chasing him

185
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:54,710
I’m afraid my tattoo power will be exhausted.

186
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,430
Forget it.

187
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,430
No longer going to chase ?

188
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,720
10 days later

189
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,550
You’re courting death !

190
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,760
My tattoo power won't hold for long.

191
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:43,950
Junior,

192
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,230
get the hell out of here !

193
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,030
If you keep following me

194
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:50,070
don’t blame this old man for taking your life !

195
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:04,000
4 months later

196
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,470
Wang Lin,

197
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:04,950
aren't you done yet ?

198
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,720
Thanks to Senior,

199
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:10,010
Junior can use this rare occasion

200
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:12,670
to refine his artifact mastery.

201
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,590
Apart from the rift we came from

202
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,990
there’s no other way out.

203
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,870
You are

204
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:30,230
trapped here !

205
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:41,310
This old man will send you to hell,

206
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,430
you have no way out !

207
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,430
No !!!

208
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,230
Now I can’t leave this place

209
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,630
and you cannot leave either.

210
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,350
This old man won’t let you go !!!

211
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,470
A madman,

212
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,510
you’re a madman !

213
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,830
I hope to borrow the clan’s spirit

214
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,190
to open a passage.

215
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:32,760
Ancestral Spirit Tree
Forsaken Immortal Clan

216
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:43,750
Master,

217
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,750
why did you destroy the exit ?

218
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,510
How are we supposed to leave now ?

219
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:39,130
To let go of the consequences of my actions

220
00:19:39,130 --> 00:19:40,850
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

221
00:19:40,890 --> 00:19:42,790
like scattered ink.

222
00:19:43,670 --> 00:19:50,270
As destiny falls

223
00:19:46,510 --> 00:19:50,270
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

224
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:57,870
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

225
00:19:53,510 --> 00:19:57,870
wither and melt into rivers.

226
00:19:58,310 --> 00:20:05,430
Who can deceive

227
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:05,430
the law of the heavens ?

228
00:20:05,750 --> 00:20:08,750
Countless generations

229
00:20:07,030 --> 00:20:08,750
have tried before me.

230
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:12,470
But how could I not catch my dreams

231
00:20:10,870 --> 00:20:12,470
within my warm fingers ?

232
00:20:13,030 --> 00:20:16,550
You're at my side when I'm alone

233
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:19,870
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

234
00:20:20,630 --> 00:20:23,830
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

235
00:20:24,190 --> 00:20:28,030
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

236
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:28,030
in the streets.

237
00:20:28,190 --> 00:20:32,990
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

238
00:20:29,750 --> 00:20:32,990
Can I break the rules ?

239
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,710
To run towards you !

240
00:20:35,750 --> 00:20:39,030
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

241
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:43,670
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

242
00:20:43,670 --> 00:20:47,070
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

243
00:20:47,110 --> 00:20:51,750
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

244
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:57,430
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

245
00:20:57,550 --> 00:21:01,350
If your soul is willing to wander,

246
00:21:01,350 --> 00:21:05,990
can I still take your hands

247
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:05,990
and hold them tight ?

248
00:21:06,150 --> 00:21:09,070
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

249
00:21:09,070 --> 00:21:13,950
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

250
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:17,230
I dream of destroying

251
00:21:17,390 --> 00:21:21,950
the shackles of our fate.

252
00:21:21,950 --> 00:21:25,910
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

253
00:21:25,910 --> 00:21:28,710
You're the hardest to let go of.

254
00:21:28,790 --> 00:21:32,590
I want to be with you again

255
00:21:32,670 --> 00:21:35,950
so I can look in your eyes.

256
00:21:36,230 --> 00:21:41,190
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
